      "prov:value": "Whenever a node's shape matters and you are not in this repository's CI. That is the case the tool exists for: `tools/` is an INHERITED declaration and `.github/workflows/` is not, so a downstream instance gets this and gets none of the 41 gates. #363's self-sovereign topology has no CI to inherit from at all.",
